OL,5,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,6,     FHigh-octane medical emergencies
OL,7,     Finclude a man found collapsed in a
OL,8,     Fhotel room, a head-on collision
OL,9,     Fbetween two motorcyclists, and an
OL,10,     F11-year-old who's taken a tumble
OL,11,     Ffrom his scooter.
OL,12,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,13,     FBirmingham, Norwich, and Maidstone
OL,14,     FA&E teams face intense challenges,
OL,15,     Ffrom gunshot wounds to heart
OL,16,     Femergencies and assaults, showing
OL,17,     Ftheir resilience under pressure.
OL,18,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,19,     FInsight at a specialist clinic
OL,20,     Fwhere a team of top dermatologists
OL,21,     Ftreats a range of conditions.
