OL,5,G0000 Street Cops: Catching the Yobs
OL,6,     FA unit of armed officers are
OL,7,     Fcalled to a high street after a
OL,8,     Fbank customer takes his rage out
OL,9,     Fon passing street cops. And PC
OL,10,     FJosh chases down a potential drug
OL,11,     Fdeal in a park.
OL,12,G0100 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,13,G     Speeders
OL,14,     FPC Doran pursues a gang of thieves
OL,15,     Ffleeing a robbery in Ellesmere
OL,16,     FPort. And PC Swash races to the
OL,17,     Fscene of a head-on car collision
OL,18,     Fthat leaves a driver trapped.
