OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     F...Second Counts. While there's a
OL,7,     Fshortage of space on specialist
OL,8,     Fwards, a man is blue lit into
OL,9,     Fcasualty after a fall, and an
OL,10,     Fambulance rushes in Betty, 75, who
OL,11,     Fhas been vomiting blood.
OL,12,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FInsight at a specialist clinic
OL,14,     Fwhere four top dermatologists
OL,15,     Ftreat a range of conditions.
